inanepain/http:
	Http client (psr-18), request and response object message interfaces (psr-7).
	Progress Notification:
		Handle sending notifications to listeners.
		- Replace both current systems with a single one.
		- Use WeakMap for Listeners
			This is an array that holds the events the listener is interested in.
			- upload: key for server sending data progress
			- download: key for server recieving data progress
		- notify: will send a progress event to listener with relavent data